<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>WorldCascade — 80 Predictions. One Engine. The World, Quantified.</title>
<meta name="description" content="WorldCascade tracks 80 predictions across 10 domains, scored by a transparent engine. Historical backtests: Brier 0.096, 97.1% hit rate.">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0A0A0F;
  --bg-card: #13131A;
  --bg-elev: #1A1A26;
  --text: #E8E8ED;
  --text-dim: #8888A0;
  --text-muted: #5A5A70;
  --accent: #6366F1;
  --accent-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
  --border: #1E1E2E;
  --high: #10B981;
  --med: #F59E0B;
  --low: #EF4444;
  --mono: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;
  --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Roboto, sans-serif;
  --display: 'Avenir Next', 'Avenir', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  line-height: 1.6;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

/* ===== HERO ===== */
.hero {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-canvas {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  z-index: 0;
}
.hero::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0%, transparent 40%, rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.7) 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
}
.nav {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 1.5rem 3rem;
}
.brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.brand-mark {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  display: inline-block;
}
.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 2rem;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}
.nav-links a {
  transition: color 0.2s ease;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }

.hero-content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 0 2rem;
  max-width: 960px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.hero-kv {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 300;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1;
}
.hero-kv .num {
  display: block;
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 200;
}
.hero-kv .lbl {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-weight: 500;
}
.hero-kv .divider {
  color: var(--accent);
  opacity: 0.6;
  align-self: center;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  display: none;
}
.hero-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.3em;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  opacity: 0.9;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
  color: var(--text-dim);
  max-width: 600px;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.hero-cta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
}
.btn {
  padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
  border-radius: 2px;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  font-family: inherit;
  display: inline-block;
}
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: white;
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  background: #4F46E5;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.btn-ghost {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text);
  border-color: var(--border);
}
.btn-ghost:hover {
  border-color: var(--text-dim);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
}

.scroll-hint {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 2rem;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  z-index: 2;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.scroll-hint::after {
  content: '';
  display: block;
  width: 1px;
  height: 32px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--text-muted), transparent);
  margin: 0.75rem auto 0;
}

/* ===== SECTIONS ===== */
section {
  padding: 6rem 2rem;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.section-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.3em;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.section-title {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.section-desc {
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 1rem;
  max-width: 640px;
  margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
}

/* ===== CHAINS ===== */
.chains-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 3rem;
}
.chain {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 2rem;
  transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}
.chain:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.chain-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.chain-id {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--accent);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}
.chain-type {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
}
.chain-title {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  letter-spacing: -0.005em;
}
.chain-desc {
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
}
.chain-nodes {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}
.c-node {
  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
  background: var(--bg-elev);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
  color: var(--text);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.c-node.high { border-color: var(--high); color: var(--high); }
.c-node.med { border-color: var(--med); color: var(--med); }
.c-node.low { border-color: var(--low); color: var(--low); }
.c-arrow {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 1rem;
}
.chain-predictions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  padding-top: 1rem;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
}
.p-chip {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
  background: var(--bg-elev);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}
.p-chip:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: var(--text);
}
.p-chip .score {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ===== TRUST ===== */
.trust {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.trust::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
}
.trust-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.3em;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.trust-title {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}
.trust-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 2rem;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
}
.trust-metric .t-num {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  display: block;
}
.trust-metric .t-lbl {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-family: var(--sans);
}
.trust-metric .t-sub {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-top: 0.35rem;
  font-family: var(--mono);
}
.trust-note {
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  max-width: 520px;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  font-style: italic;
}
.trust-cta {
  display: inline-flex;
}

/* ===== FOOTER ===== */
footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 3rem 2rem;
  margin-top: 4rem;
}
.footer-inner {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.footer-brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text);
}
.footer-meta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 2rem;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.footer-meta a:hover { color: var(--text); }
.footer-meta .dot { color: var(--text-muted); }

/* ===== PREDICTIONS HUB ===== */
.ph-controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.ph-domains {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.domain-btn {
  padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}
.domain-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--text-dim);
  color: var(--text);
}
.domain-btn.active {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: var(--text);
  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08);
}
.domain-btn .d-count {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}
.domain-btn.active .d-count {
  color: var(--accent);
}
.ph-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.ph-conf {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.25rem;
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
  padding: 0.2rem;
}
.conf-btn {
  padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  cursor: pointer;
  border-radius: 2px;
  transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}
.conf-btn:hover { color: var(--text); }
.conf-btn.active {
  background: var(--bg-elev);
  color: var(--text);
}
.ph-sort {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}
.ph-sort label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
.ph-sort select {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  border-radius: 2px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.ph-sort select:hover { border-color: var(--text-dim); }

.ph-stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}
.ph-stats .stat-lbl { color: var(--text-muted); margin-right: 0.4rem; }
.ph-stats .stat-val { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

.ph-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}
.p-card {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 3px;
  padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  min-height: 180px;
}
.p-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
}
.p-card-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}
.p-card-head .p-id { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
.p-domain-tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.3rem;
  padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
  background: var(--bg-elev);
  border-radius: 2px;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
}
.p-title {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--text);
  min-height: 2.6em;
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.p-score-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.35rem;
}
.p-score-bar {
  position: relative;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--bg-elev);
  border-radius: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.p-score-fill {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  border-radius: 2px;
  transition: width 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}
.p-score-fill.high { background: var(--high); }
.p-score-fill.med { background: var(--med); }
.p-score-fill.low { background: var(--low); }
.p-score-nums {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}
.p-score-val { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.p-score-lbl { color: var(--text-muted); }
.p-orig { color: var(--text-dim); }
.p-foot {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding-top: 0.5rem;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}
.p-foot .p-days { color: var(--text); }

.ph-empty {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .ph-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .ph-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 1rem; }
}

/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .nav { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  section { padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
  .hero-kv {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .trust-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  .chain { padding: 1.5rem; }
  .chain-nodes { font-size: 0.7rem; }
  .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .scroll-hint { display: none; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}

@media print {
  .hero-canvas, .scroll-hint { display: none; }
  body { background: white; color: black; }
  .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 2rem; }
  .chain, .trust { background: white; border-color: #ccc; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <canvas class="hero-canvas" id="starfield" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="14" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/>
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="2" fill="#6366F1"/>
        <circle cx="7" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="#E8E8ED" opacity="0.7"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="10" r="1.5" fill="#E8E8ED" opacity="0.7"/>
        <circle cx="22" cy="23" r="1.5" fill="#E8E8ED" opacity="0.7"/>
        <circle cx="10" cy="24" r="1.5" fill="#E8E8ED" opacity="0.7"/>
        <line x1="16" y1="16" x2="7" y2="12" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.5"/>
        <line x1="16" y1="16" x2="24" y2="10" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.5"/>
        <line x1="16" y1="16" x2="22" y2="23" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.5"/>
        <line x1="16" y1="16" x2="10" y2="24" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.5"/>
      </svg>
      <span>WorldCascade</span>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#chains">Causal Chains</a>
      <a href="#trust">Track Record</a>
      <a href="#methodology">Methodology</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-tag">World Simulation Engine · v4.0.0</div>
    <h1 class="hero-kv" aria-label="80 predictions, 10 domains, 1 engine">
      <span><span class="num" data-count="80">80</span><span class="lbl">Predictions</span></span>
      <span><span class="num" data-count="10">10</span><span class="lbl">Domains</span></span>
      <span><span class="num">1</span><span class="lbl">Engine</span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">We model 80 possible futures — and score every one with a transparent, reproducible engine. Not opinion. Not speculation. Engineered foresight.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#predictions">Explore Predictions</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#chains">See the Causal Chains →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">Scroll</div>
</header>

<main>
  <section id="chains" aria-labelledby="chains-title">
    <div class="section-tag">// 01 · Causal Architecture</div>
    <h2 id="chains-title" class="section-title">Predictions don't live in isolation.</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Behind 80 forecasts lies a hidden architecture — causal chains where AI, energy, population, and technology trigger each other. Change one node, and the future reshapes.</p>

    <div class="chains-list">

      <article class="chain">
        <div class="chain-head">
          <span class="chain-id">CC-01</span>
          <span class="chain-type">Cross-Domain</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="chain-title">AI Craves Power → Energy Map Rewritten</h3>
